# Route: guide 45 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 17 quests, 0.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades, Stranglethorn Vale): The Bulwark -> Gurubashi Arena
# -> Booty Bay -> Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay
# -> Wild Shore.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

